<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:55:54Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-ger" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1432?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Bundeswehr study exposes widespread sexual harassment in German military</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a3f5ca0f32f6e4f7615efb292273a59dafcf4638dd7ffa989e84dccbeaa3e22</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:55:48Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T08:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bundeswehr-study-exposes-widespread-sexual-harassment-in-german-military/a-79926359--0cec81791758.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bundeswehr-study-exposes-widespread-sexual-harassment-in-german-military/a-79926359?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sexual misconduct in the Bundeswehr is far more widespread than previously known, with younger women disproportionately affected. Defense Minister Boris Pistorius has called for a policy of "zero tolerance."</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Police raid chapters of Gremium MC biker gang</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ee0f422122c9e6d22380ee9a8c4e827929f306694fb60bf1c1d7836f1fbe72c</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:55:42Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T09:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-raid-chapters-of-gremium-mc-biker-gang/live-79926275--65b7228f3ec1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-raid-chapters-of-gremium-mc-biker-gang/live-79926275?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Police in southwestern Germany launched major early-morning operations against a biker gang. The state of Baden-Württemberg is outlawing three of its chapters. Meanwhile, unions are planning more strikes. Follow DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>VW scraps production modernization plan citing tough financial straits</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:578a2add35843bb95d9807dca4e9e109a6f8b163cfdcbf9a01d120999b5e062e</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:54:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T19:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/vw-scraps-production-modernization-plan-citing-tough-financial-straits/a-79923597--b06c676e46e8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/vw-scraps-production-modernization-plan-citing-tough-financial-straits/a-79923597?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">VW has announced that it will scrap large-scale modernization in light of its current economic situation. Employee representatives accuse leadership of putting short-term profits before long-term company viability.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Only 1/3 of Germans satisfied with state of democracy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:061aa1ad6e5f044107369c1b12cbc176485c940270f0eef4f816ec22a71370e3</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:54:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T11:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-only-1-3-of-germans-satisfied-with-state-of-democracy/live-79915066--348a315bae46.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-only-1-3-of-germans-satisfied-with-state-of-democracy/live-79915066?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A new authoritarianism study has revealed a new low in satisfaction levels with the functioning of German democracy. Meanwhile, the Bundeswehr has banned Chinese-made drones. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Why the integration of immigrants in Germany remains a challenge</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3837a9e6681025a1396f5291810f698b1ea0cf16489df9443da49b96bbe9afaa</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:55:54Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T17:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-the-integration-of-immigrants-in-germany-remains-a-challenge/a-79923241--a319297bc2a0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-the-integration-of-immigrants-in-germany-remains-a-challenge/a-79923241?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Federal Office for Migration and Refugees has released a new Integration Report. It found that while the integration of people with a migrant background is improving, violent youth remain a problem.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Democracy study: One-quarter of Germans want a right-wing authoritarian dictatorship</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6ac1a41556b96c78ec6ae1b97599faeacfca86d0e4fbd2889bc408f5eb07cbf2</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:54:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T16:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/democracy-study-one-quarter-of-germans-want-a-right-wing-authoritarian-dictatorship/a-79922718--e6377f13d887.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/democracy-study-one-quarter-of-germans-want-a-right-wing-authoritarian-dictatorship/a-79922718?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The far-right AfD's electoral successes point to a new trend in Germany: Prejudice, resentment, and extremism are on the rise. A new study suggests satisfaction with democracy is at a low ebb.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Germany slips in climate protection rankings as other countries make gains</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:91a94ce83b477114d34bff0ef91cb61ff6c994162bc2e1e3e481966bb720ec7b</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:54:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T06:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-slips-in-climate-protection-rankings-as-other-countries-make-gains/a-79913635--edb7d622928e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-slips-in-climate-protection-rankings-as-other-countries-make-gains/a-79913635?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Record renewable energy growth is driving climate progress in some countries, but Germany and many major emitters are falling behind.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Controversial kinship: From colonial rule to the Holocaust?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8f76c7e05c11313d30e8d7067d1e8d931963f44093b88ccbdc62e92e4efa39c5</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:54:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T15:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/controversial-kinship-from-colonial-rule-to-the-holocaust/a-79902228--16129c6452e2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/controversial-kinship-from-colonial-rule-to-the-holocaust/a-79902228?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Hitler once called Eastern Europe "Germany's India." A new exhibition examines the links between colonialism and Nazism, and the bitter debate over where comparisons illuminate history and where they fall short.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Wael Mohya could make German football history at 17</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be802f4fbe22400806003fdff8c383adf8ff7b793e01664687487bfe0ae129a9</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:54:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T15:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wael-mohya-could-make-german-football-history-at-17/a-79919787--677b2c671ea6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wael-mohya-could-make-german-football-history-at-17/a-79919787?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At just 17, Gladbach forward Wael Mohya has earned his first Germany call-up. The dual-national talent has chosen the DFB path for now — and could soon make modern national-team history.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
